{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46659","headline":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见闲云 · 齐己","name":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见闲云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病起见闲云，空中聚又分。\n滞留堪笑我，舒卷不如君。\n触石终无迹，从风或有闻。\n仙山足鸾凤，归去自同羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46659.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46659","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}